{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12711","headline":"宿洄溪翁宅 · 元结","name":"宿洄溪翁宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长松万株遶茅舍，怪石寒泉近岩下。\n老翁八十犹能行，将领儿孙行拾稼。\n吾羡老翁居处幽，吾爱老翁无所求。\n时俗是非何足道，得似老翁吾即休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}